B.bx_=s(["The embryo is now about the size of a pea.","The average crown\u2013rump length is about 0.2 inches (0.5 cm).","The eyes, nostrils, and arms are taking shape.","The heart is beating at about 110 beats per minute and sometimes may be seen using a transvaginal ultrasound at this time."],t.s)
