B.bbC=s(["The ears are standing out, and the fetus is beginning to respond to sound.","The average 18-week fetus is 8.7 inches (22.2 cm) long and weighs 7.9 ounces (223 grams).","The thyroid becomes fully functional at 18 to 20 weeks.","The cerebellar vermis can be demonstrated to be fully formed on ultrasound at this age."],t.s)
